(7671810, 1252544, 98565, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by primabarbara:</b></div><hr/><i> And - will you eat it now, Anita???<br/>Looks like too much chemical colour additions, doesn''t it? But this is perfect for the shot.<br/>Congrats! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>No I didnt eat any, I didnt even buy them. Took the shot in the grocery store and then bought a few more goods and left. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>LOL</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Originally posted by primabarbara: And - will you eat it now, Anita???Looks like too much chemical colour additions, doesn''t it? But this is perfect for the shot.Congrats!   No I didnt eat any, I didnt even buy them. Took the shot in the grocery store and then bought a few more goods and left.   LOL', '2020-08-07 17:03:38.000000', NULL, 0),
